.TH "CHECK_WEATHER" "1" "April 2026" "NMS_Tools" "Deterministic Weather Monitoring Tool"
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
\f[B]check_weather\f[R] \[em] deterministic weather condition evaluator
with provider registry and alert engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]check_weather\f[R] \[en]city \[en]provider \[en]json \[en]verbose
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]check_weather\f[R] \[en]debug-cache \[en]debug-location
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]check_weather\f[R] \[en]ttl \[en]ignore-ttl \[en]ignore-cache
\[en]cache-info
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]check_weather\f[R] retrieves and evaluates current and forecast
weather conditions using deterministic JSON schemas and a unified
provider architecture.
The tool supports multiple weather providers, cache handling, slicing
normalization, astronomy fields, index calculations, and NWS alert
ingestion.
.PP
The tool is designed for monitoring systems, automation pipelines, and
operator\[u2011]grade diagnostics.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS \[en]city 
.PP
City or location name to resolve.
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Supports Open\[u2011]Meteo geocoding and NWS station lookup.
.SS \[en]provider 
.PP
Override provider selection.
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Examples: \f[V]openmeteo\f[R], \f[V]nws\f[R].
.SS \[en]json
.PP
Emit deterministic JSON output.
.SS \[en]verbose
.PP
Emit human\[u2011]readable verbose output.
.SS \[en]debug-cache
.PP
Display cache path, age, TTL, and hit/miss status.
.SS \[en]debug-location
.PP
Display resolved coordinates, station ID, and lookup method.
.SS \[en]ttl 
.PP
Override cache TTL.
.SS \[en]ignore-ttl
.PP
Bypass TTL check and force API fetch.
.SS \[en]ignore-cache
.PP
Skip cache entirely.
.SS \[en]cache-info
.PP
Display cache metadata without fetching.
.SS \[en]help
.PP
Show help text.
.SH EXIT CODES
.PP
\f[B]0\f[R] \[em] OK
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]1\f[R] \[em] WARNING
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]2\f[R] \[em] CRITICAL
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]3\f[R] \[em] UNKNOWN
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Basic usage
.PP
check_weather \[en]city \[lq]Wichita, KS\[rq]
.SS JSON output
.PP
check_weather \[en]city \[lq]Wichita, KS\[rq] \[en]json
.SS Force API fetch
.PP
check_weather \[en]city \[lq]Wichita, KS\[rq] \[en]ignore-cache
.SS Debug cache
.PP
check_weather \[en]debug-cache \[en]city \[lq]Wichita, KS\[rq]
